{"type":"node","id":"fix001","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-001 解析期错误 JSON 化（含 ISSUE-001/005）","description":"","content":"【根因】parseArgv 从左到右扫描即抛：未知命令/未知选项/缺值/多余参数等 USAGE 错误发生在 --json 收集之前，main.js catch 里 Output 为默认无 json 模式 → stdout 无 JSON。--version 立即 return 同理。\n【改动】cli.js：解析错误 defer 暂存（首个优先）继续扫描收集全局选项，错误随返回值 parseError 字段交 main（不在 parseArgv 抛，保证 main 先建好输出通道）；--version 改 versionFlag 延迟返回。main.js：parsed.parseError 经 Output(globals) 输出；version 分支 json 模式输出 {\"ok\":true,\"version\":...}\n【验证】未知命令/未知选项/多余参数 + --json 均输出单行 JSON exit=2；--version --json 输出 JSON；49/49 测试全绿","extensions":{"files":"src/cli.js,src/main.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:43:14.346Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:43:14.346Z","version":1,"hash":"9f13d880f924e0dc93ae80b8d07f0fac14d09000e236367ae6d42b740c5ed014","tags":["fix","cli","json"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"fix001","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"9f13d880f924e0dc93ae80b8d07f0fac14d09000e236367ae6d42b740c5ed014","timestamp":"2026-09-09T16:43:14.346Z","user":null,"version":1}
