{"type":"node","id":"fix002","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-002 export/AMBIGUOUS_ID 显示修正（ISSUE-002/003）","description":"","content":"【ISSUE-002】export stdout 分支补 nodes 计数，与 --output 模式形状统一（content/bytes/root/nodes）\n【ISSUE-003】AMBIGUOUS_ID 候选列表：ID≤8 字符原样显示，>8 才截断加省略号（原 ab1… 误导为截断）\n【验证】两种 export 模式 nodes 一致；短 ID 无省略号、UUID 前缀仍正常截断；49/49 绿","extensions":{"files":"src/commands/export.js,src/packet.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:44:05.885Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:44:05.885Z","version":1,"hash":"2a533a975054b172d5013e0d386116b8eee4007282b0e311235ac2d02f4e78e0","tags":["fix","export","errmsg"],"status":"review"}
