{"type":"node","id":"fix003","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-003 写路径篡改巡检 warnings（ISSUE-004）","description":"","content":"【设计】不阻断写入（保持既定语义：仅 STRUCTURE 阻断），但加载时巡检当前状态节点哈希，发现不匹配 → 写命令 JSON 附 warnings 字段 + stderr 黄色提示\n【改动】packet.js 新增 hashMismatches()（与 verify 同源校验）；main.js ctx.load() 缓存 __hashWarnings 并 stderr 预警；_shared.js 新增 hashWarnFields()；add/update/rm/mv/checkout 五个写命令 out.ok 透传\n【边界确认】篡改历史版本行不可检出（append-only 重放模型只锚定最新状态，后行覆盖前行）；写入即洗白（哈希重算），警告仅在洗白前最后一次机会发出\n【验证】篡改当前状态行后 update JSON warnings+stderr 正确；干净包无 warnings 字段 stderr 干净；49/49 绿","extensions":{"files":"src/packet.js,src/main.js,src/commands/_shared.js,src/commands/add.js,src/commands/update.js,src/commands/rm.js,src/commands/mv.js,src/commands/checkout.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:46:54.650Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:46:54.650Z","version":1,"hash":"ca170c302e3926c3f49d960f4dc7aed114e09d2eda175145d27748d44ab962ca","tags":["fix","integrity","write-path"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"fix003","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"ca170c302e3926c3f49d960f4dc7aed114e09d2eda175145d27748d44ab962ca","timestamp":"2026-09-09T16:46:54.650Z","user":null,"version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:46:54.650Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue001","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-001 未知命令时 --json 无 stdout 输出","description":"未知命令报错未走 JSON 输出通道，违反 Agent 集成契约（所有命令含报错应在 stdout 输出单行 JSON）","content":"【复现】dtp frobnicate --packet ./x.dtp --json；2>/dev/null 后 stdout 为空，exit=2\n【期望】stdout: {\"ok\":false,\"error\":{\"code\":\"USAGE\",\"message\":\"未知命令 …\"}}\n【实际】stdout 空，仅 stderr 有人类可读行\n【影响】Agent 解析 stdout 拿到空串，契约破裂\n【修复方向】main.js 未知命令分支接入 JSON 错误输出","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"main.js","fixed_in":"v1.2.0"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.440Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:47:20.112Z","version":3,"hash":"bf0cfc52f91564ef42d1c0134e10e36fad54d603e4ff4125b98f99606e093293","tags":["P2","cli","json","contract"],"status":"approved"}
