{"type":"node","id":"issue010","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-010 无位置参数命令的多余参数报错无 --packet 提示","description":"verify/pack/query 等无位置参数命令对 dtp verify 包文件.dtp 这类自然调用报「多余的参数」却不提示应使用 --packet","content":"【复现】dtp verify mypacket.dtp --json → {\"code\":\"USAGE\",\"message\":\"多余的参数 \"mypacket.dtd\"（查看 dtp verify --help）\"}\n【期望】对零位置参数命令追加提示：不接受位置参数，指定数据包请用 --packet\n【实际】仅指向 --help，多一步往返\n【影响】高频自然写法（把包路径当位置参数）得不到直接行动指引\n【修复方向】cli.js 多余参数分支按 argSpecs.length===0 定制消息","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"cli.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.791Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.196Z","version":2,"hash":"0f1d5b8d69497543aaf2a0e67806381ff4b8f23a7a5d0f5155762bb5494ba5f9","tags":["P3","cli","usage"],"status":"review"}
