{"type":"node","id":"fix005","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-005 标题规范化与 query 路径校验（ISSUE-008/009/010 + OPTIM-002）","description":"query --path 不可解析改报 NOT_FOUND（与 get-path 一致，消除静默空集）；validateTitle 统一 trim 且 init 包名同规范化（消除三入口空白行为不一致）；零位置参数命令的多余参数错误附 --packet 指引；query --limit 截断时人类输出提示总数。新增 test/edges.test.js 7 组回归（含转义寻址/同位 mv/checkout 同版基线）","content":"","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.3.0","issues":"ISSUE-008,ISSUE-009,ISSUE-010,OPTIM-002"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.594Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:57.124Z","version":2,"hash":"5e8aebcb5221b833c98344b8c9d9da4cca9d16116e26759ec1108fa52246af88","tags":["P2","P3","query","title","cli","ux"],"status":"approved"}
