{"type":"node","id":"optim004","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-004 无增量标签增删：update --tags 仅整体替换","description":"追加单个标签必须重新列出全部已有标签，需先 get 回读——回归工作流高频摩擦","content":"【现状】update --tags 只能整体替换：给某节点追加一个标签必须重列全部已有标签（需先 get 回读），移除亦然\\n【建议】支持 --tags +P3 增量添加 / --tags -cli 增量移除；无 +/- 前缀仍为整体替换（向后兼容）\\n【落地】已实现：update 对含 +/- 前缀的 --tags 求增量并解析为完整集合（见 FIX-006）","extensions":{"severity":"P3","files":"src/commands/update.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T01:52:14.537Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T01:52:14.537Z","version":1,"hash":"c64d7adc49db499c147855bc94a5dcf9360c21e929a6e5d9f028f68c7082b76c","tags":["P3","update","tags"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim004","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"c64d7adc49db499c147855bc94a5dcf9360c21e929a6e5d9f028f68c7082b76c","timestamp":"2026-09-10T01:52:14.537Z","user":null,"version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T01:52:14.537Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim005","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-005 标签大小写敏感，与 type/status 大小写宽容不一致","description":"p0 与 P0 是两个不同标签，query --tag P0 查不到 p0；而 --type/--status 大小写宽容（见 OPTIM-001）","content":"【现状】tag 写入按字面存储：--tags p0 存为 \"p0\"，query --tag P0 不命中（仅 --tag p0 命中）；与 type/status 的统一小写归一化策略不一致\\n【建议】对写入与查询做同侧 case 归一化（如统一小写），彻底消除 P0/p0 歧义\\n【取舍】tag 是自由元数据，可能有大小写有意义的场景；归一化会丢失该区分。倾向保留敏感并在文档说明，故暂缓\\n【验证】T9 用例：p0 vs P0 两套命中集不同（大小写敏感）","extensions":{"severity":"P4","area":"query"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T01:52:14.572Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T01:52:14.572Z","version":1,"hash":"ea5df9ad32060604abaff17e108fbdfeedd8cd7d0c1473dd95f1d8349dc9e651","tags":["P4","tags","query"],"status":"draft"}
