{"type":"node","id":"optim006","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-006 query --keyword 不检索 tags","description":"keyword 只匹配标题/描述/正文，标签不参与；--keyword auth 查不到仅以 auth 为标签的节点","content":"【现状】节点 auth（标题「认证模块」标签 auth）→ dtp query --keyword auth → 0 命中\n【说明】README 明确 keyword = 标题+描述+正文，属既定语义\n【建议】保持语义，文档/提示引导「搜索标签用 --tag」；暂缓","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"commands/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.987Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T04:26:26.987Z","version":1,"hash":"5bc75863cf350b073345235b942764175a0a3bdc52e0e5763f24c24be0c61e51","tags":["P3","query","keyword"],"status":"draft"}
