{"type":"node","id":"issue015","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-015 前缀歧义消息不列候选（resolveIdAny）","description":"resolveIdAny 对前缀歧义只报数量不列候选，history/checkout 无法据此消歧；resolveRef 却会列出前 5 个","content":"【复现】dtp history amb → 前缀 \"amb\" 匹配 2 个节点（无候选列表）\n【对照】dtp get amb（resolveRef）→ 前缀 \"amb\" 匹配 2 个节点：amb1, amb2\n【期望】两条解析路径的歧义消息一致，均列出候选\n【实际】resolveIdAny 缺失候选，多一步往返/无法消歧\n【修复方向】抽取候选格式化助手，resolveRef 与 resolveIdAny 共用","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"packet.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.288Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:23:23.032Z","version":2,"hash":"b97f356ed6a383f7360817fd9cfc1f1f8c3a783560562cfd07bf6864782232b1","tags":["P3","history","checkout","errmsg"],"status":"review"}
