{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T07:06:20.985Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim010","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-010 ls 无 --limit，长列表无法裁剪","description":"ls 仅支持 --recursive，无 --limit，无法裁剪长列表输出","content":"【现状】ls 只返回根/指定节点的全部直接子节点（或递归全子树），无条数裁剪；对高达 16+ 条的子节点列表只能全量打印\n【建议】为 ls 增加 --limit <n>，只列出前 n 条，JSON 增加 total 字段、人类输出附截断提示\n【取舍】采纳：与 history/query --limit 语义一致（严格非负整数），低风险增量；排序沿用既有码点序，无歧义\n【验证】新增 ls --limit 回归用例：合法值截断、非法值（1.5/-1/abc）报 USAGE exit2、无 --limit 时 total===count 不破坏既有契约","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"src/commands/ls.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T07:06:41.143Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T07:06:41.143Z","version":1,"hash":"8418755b420dd29b0951ff62daa9889da8c48e148b2218dbdd6b240cd41de82d","tags":["P3","ls","ux"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim010","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"8418755b420dd29b0951ff62daa9889da8c48e148b2218dbdd6b240cd41de82d","timestamp":"2026-09-10T07:06:41.143Z","user":"agent","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T07:06:41.143Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim011","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-011 query 无 --parent，只能全量语义路径","description":"query 仅 --path（须从根写全量语义路径），无按父节点 id 过滤的能力","content":"【现状】query 过滤只能走 --path 语义路径前缀（含自身+子树），须精确写出从根开始的全量路径（如 “/dtp 功能回归任务包/问题登记”）；已知父节点 id/前缀时无法按它过滤\n【建议】增加 --parent <ref>（支持 id/唯一前缀/语义路径），仅返回该父节点的直接子节点（与 ls <folder> 语义一致、与 --path 互补）\n【取舍】采纳：保持直接子节点语义避免与 --path 子树重叠歧义；引用解析复用 resolveRef，与其它命令一致\n【验证】新增 query --parent 回归用例：按 id/前缀/路径均可命中直接子节点、不含子孙、父节点不存在报 NOT_FOUND、空值报 USAGE","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"src/commands/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T07:06:41.178Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T07:06:41.178Z","version":1,"hash":"8c2734f275904e7cf7ea0fc4c3be131327dd6d2e8a828cae4a7a8643dbadf29f","tags":["P3","query","ux"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim011","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"8c2734f275904e7cf7ea0fc4c3be131327dd6d2e8a828cae4a7a8643dbadf29f","timestamp":"2026-09-10T07:06:41.178Z","user":"agent","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T07:06:41.178Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"fix009","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-009 ls --limit 与 query --parent（OPTIM-010/011）","description":"为 ls 增加 --limit 裁剪、query 增加 --parent 按父节点过滤","content":"【根因】摩擦点：ls 无 --limit 无法裁剪长列表（OPTIM-010）；query 无 --parent，只能写全量语义路径（OPTIM-011）\n【改动】src/commands/ls.js：新增 --limit 选项，严格非负整数校验（非法值 USAGE exit2），JSON 增加 total 字段，截断时人类输出附「共 N 个（--limit 截断）」提示；src/query.js：filterNodes 新增 parentId 维度；src/commands/query.js：新增 --parent <ref> 选项（复用 resolveRef 支持 id/唯一前缀/语义路径，仅返回直接子节点，与 --path 互补，可与 tag/type/status 等 AND）。同步更新 .agents/skills/dtp-regression/SKILL.md 参数边界清单\n【验证】新增 test/ls-query-edges.test.js 4 组：ls --limit 合法截断与 total、非法值（1.5/-1/abc 等）均 USAGE exit2；query --parent 按 id/前缀/路径命中直接子节点、可 AND 组合、父节点缺失 NOT_FOUND、空值 USAGE；67/67 测试全绿（63 基线 + 4 新增）","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.5.1","issues":"OPTIM-010,OPTIM-011","files":"src/commands/ls.js,src/commands/query.js,src/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T07:08:17.712Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T07:08:17.712Z","version":1,"hash":"19a42f7327fa648f7dfbbfc1080c64f01f08be86f481b64657259c6b9a320db0","tags":["fix","ls","query","ux"],"status":"review"}
