{"type":"node","id":"fix009","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-009 ls --limit 与 query --parent（OPTIM-010/011）","description":"为 ls 增加 --limit 裁剪、query 增加 --parent 按父节点过滤","content":"【根因】摩擦点：ls 无 --limit 无法裁剪长列表（OPTIM-010）；query 无 --parent，只能写全量语义路径（OPTIM-011）\n【改动】src/commands/ls.js：新增 --limit 选项，严格非负整数校验（非法值 USAGE exit2），JSON 增加 total 字段，截断时人类输出附「共 N 个（--limit 截断）」提示；src/query.js：filterNodes 新增 parentId 维度；src/commands/query.js：新增 --parent <ref> 选项（复用 resolveRef 支持 id/唯一前缀/语义路径，仅返回直接子节点，与 --path 互补，可与 tag/type/status 等 AND）。同步更新 .agents/skills/dtp-regression/SKILL.md 参数边界清单\n【验证】新增 test/ls-query-edges.test.js 4 组：ls --limit 合法截断与 total、非法值（1.5/-1/abc 等）均 USAGE exit2；query --parent 按 id/前缀/路径命中直接子节点、可 AND 组合、父节点缺失 NOT_FOUND、空值 USAGE；67/67 测试全绿（63 基线 + 4 新增）","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.5.1","issues":"OPTIM-010,OPTIM-011","files":"src/commands/ls.js,src/commands/query.js,src/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T07:08:17.712Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T07:08:17.917Z","version":2,"hash":"0550ac1d5160d53d149b124f7a442b8068ce6b2d7bee9efd8201d0c771a15c86","tags":["fix","ls","query","ux"],"status":"approved"}
