{"type":"node","id":"issue018","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-018 路径输入段不 trim，与存储侧标题规范化不对称","description":"存储侧标题已 trim（FIX-005），查询输入段残留空白（含全角空格）导致视觉相同路径 NOT_FOUND","content":"【复现】add 标题「子夹」后 get-path \"/包/ 子夹\"（段首误触半角空格）→ NOT_FOUND exit 1；\"/包/\\u3000中文标题\"（全角空格）同样 NOT_FOUND；纯空白输入 \"   \" 报「路径不存在：   」（原样回显不可见空白）\n【期望】段级 trim 后匹配（存储侧段不可能带首尾空白，trim 输入是纯收益）；纯空白输入报 USAGE「路径为空」（与 resolveRef「节点引用为空」先例一致），而非误导性 NOT_FOUND\n【实际】splitSegments 仅 trim 整串不 trim 段；空段全滤后归一化为根键 \"/\" 落到 NOT_FOUND\n【影响】多语言输入法/复制粘贴场景高频摩擦：视觉相同的路径查不到，报错消息不可读\n【修复方向】splitSegments 段级 trim；get-path 对 trim 后为空的输入前置 USAGE 校验","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"src/path.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:29:29.194Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:29:29.194Z","version":1,"hash":"f063f25786c11c3df765d380c39c29f425017b221b66d9633a0994c4deac72db","tags":["P3","i18n","path","ux"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue018","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"f063f25786c11c3df765d380c39c29f425017b221b66d9633a0994c4deac72db","timestamp":"2026-09-10T10:29:29.194Z","user":"agent","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:29:29.194Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim013","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-013 get-path / 直达根节点","description":"根仅有规范路径 /标题，get-path / 报 NOT_FOUND 反直觉","content":"【现状】pathIndex 仅注册 \"/根标题\" 键，get-path / → NOT_FOUND「路径不存在：/」；根必须写 /A包 形式\n【建议】索引构建时额外注册根键 \"/\"，get-path / 命中根节点\n【取舍】采纳：改动仅一行索引注册，低风险；query --path / 维持 NOT_FOUND（前缀语义下 \"/\" 不匹配任何显示路径，且\"前缀=/\"展开为全集会违背 fail-closed），在 OPTIM 中记录此取舍\n【验证】get-path / 返回根节点；query --path / 维持 NOT_FOUND；既有 \"/根标题\" 方式不受影响","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"src/packet.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:29:29.232Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:29:29.232Z","version":1,"hash":"0a489b99dd8a43c2b203542332aaa0d04a2238825fd1d9bb200ad5672cd7b4e8","tags":["P3","path","ux"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim013","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"0a489b99dd8a43c2b203542332aaa0d04a2238825fd1d9bb200ad5672cd7b4e8","timestamp":"2026-09-10T10:29:29.232Z","user":"agent","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:29:29.232Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"fix010","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-010 语义路径 Unicode 归一化与段级 trim（ISSUE-017/018 + OPTIM-013）","description":"路径键 NFC 归一化 + 段级 trim + 根路径 / 支持","content":"【根因】① 索引键与查询键均按 UTF-16 字节匹配，无 Unicode 归一化，NFC/NFD 视觉相同路径互相 NOT_FOUND，且 assertTitleAvailable 字节比较被形式差异绕过（ISSUE-017）；② splitSegments 仅 trim 整串不 trim 段，与存储侧标题 trim（FIX-005）不对称，段残留空白（含全角空格）永远失配，纯空白输入以误导性 NOT_FOUND 收场（ISSUE-018）；③ 根仅注册 /标题 键，get-path / 反直觉 NOT_FOUND（OPTIM-013）\n【改动】src/path.js：encodeSegment NFC 归一化（索引/查询统一咽喉），splitSegments 段级 trim；src/packet.js：索引键与 pathById 统一归一化形式（子键增量拼接避免热循环全路径重算，perf 259ms 预算内），assertTitleAvailable NFC 比较，findByPath 对 / 特判直达根（不污染索引保持 verify 一一对应不变量）；src/commands/get-path.js：纯空白输入前置 USAGE「路径为空」\n【验证】新增 test/get-path-edges.test.js 9 组：NFC/NFD 互命中、视觉重名 EXISTS、段空白（半角/全角）命中、空白输入 USAGE、根 / 直达、query --path 对称、多语言 CJK/RTL/emoji/转义斜杠、契约（多余参数/未知选项/无包）、mv/rm 索引同步；76/76 全绿（67 基线 + 9 新增），perf 10k 节点 259ms < 500ms 预算","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.5.2","issues":"ISSUE-017,ISSUE-018,OPTIM-013","files":"src/path.js,src/packet.js,src/commands/get-path.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:33:14.769Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:33:14.769Z","version":1,"hash":"aaa84c1ec93f55e64534b8173aa84feb777f41c5ea02326153f71cc6a1eef432","tags":["fix","i18n","path"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"fix010","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"aaa84c1ec93f55e64534b8173aa84feb777f41c5ea02326153f71cc6a1eef432","timestamp":"2026-09-10T10:33:14.769Z","user":"agent","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:33:14.769Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue017","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-017 语义路径按字节匹配，NFC/NFD 视觉重名可共存且查找失配","description":"路径键不做 Unicode 归一化：视觉相同的 NFC/NFD 路径互相 NOT_FOUND，同级唯一性校验也被形式差异绕过","content":"【复现】scratch 包 add 两个兄弟节点标题分别为 NFC \"caf\\u00e9\" 与 NFD \"cafe\\u0301\"（视觉相同）——add 均成功（EXISTS 校验被绕过）；随后 get-path \"/包/café\" 按 NFC 输入命中 nfc 节点、NFD 输入命中 nfd 节点，从 Finder/网页复制路径（形式翻转）即 NOT_FOUND exit 1\n【期望】Unicode 规范等价（canonical equivalence）的标题/路径应视为同名：add 报 EXISTS 拒绝视觉重名；查找对 NFC/NFD 输入稳定命中\n【实际】路径索引键（packet.js encodeSegment 直拼）与查询键（normalizePathString）均按 UTF-16 字节匹配，无 NFC 归一化；assertTitleAvailable 用 === 字节比较\n【影响】多语言场景静默错误：macOS 文件名（NFD）与多数编辑器输出（NFC）形式不一致时，路径写入后无法查回；视觉重名破坏「同级标题唯一」不变量的用户可感知语义\n【修复方向】encodeSegment 内 NFC 归一化（索引/查询两侧统一咽喉）；assertTitleAvailable 改 NFC 比较；pathById 同步归一化使 query --path 与 pathOf 对称","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"src/path.js","fixed_in":"v1.5.2"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:29:29.154Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:33:14.804Z","version":2,"hash":"bc128c58996f028665cc015c652bc6fb6e32e142364c920b137ca44780d2c8e5","tags":["P2","i18n","path"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue017","field":"extensions.fixed_in","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"a3079c13141d584d6100276e0b2b0fabbb84909ad3c54940773fcda329c664b2","timestamp":"2026-09-10T10:33:14.804Z","user":"agent","version":2}
