{"type":"node","id":"optim013","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-013 get-path / 直达根节点","description":"根仅有规范路径 /标题，get-path / 报 NOT_FOUND 反直觉","content":"【现状】pathIndex 仅注册 \"/根标题\" 键，get-path / → NOT_FOUND「路径不存在：/」；根必须写 /A包 形式\n【建议】索引构建时额外注册根键 \"/\"，get-path / 命中根节点\n【取舍】采纳：改动仅一行索引注册，低风险；query --path / 维持 NOT_FOUND（前缀语义下 \"/\" 不匹配任何显示路径，且\"前缀=/\"展开为全集会违背 fail-closed），在 OPTIM 中记录此取舍\n【验证】get-path / 返回根节点；query --path / 维持 NOT_FOUND；既有 \"/根标题\" 方式不受影响","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"src/packet.js","fixed_in":"v1.5.2"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:29:29.232Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:33:14.978Z","version":3,"hash":"2a995a3f562b18291c7cd59d48a0858d5a69e3d11f08a884a5db45bf28019293","tags":["P3","path","ux"],"status":"approved"}
