{"type":"node","id":"fix011","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-011 CI runner perf 预算环境感知（DTP_PERF_BUDGET_MS）","description":"CI 共享 runner 放宽 perf 加载预算至 1500ms，本地保持 500ms 严格预算","content":"【根因】perf 用例 500ms 加载预算按本地 M 系（实测 259ms）校准，GitHub 共享 runner（2 核）实测 562-887ms，首发 CI 三组合（node18/24-ubuntu、22-macos）失败；失败组合无版本规律，为 runner 性能波动\n【改动】.github/workflows/ci.yml Run tests 步骤注入环境变量 DTP_PERF_BUDGET_MS=1500（测试既有的环境开关，零代码改动）；1500ms 与健康值（887ms）/回归值（2418ms）均有安全间距，仍可拦截热循环级性能回归\n【验证】CI 重跑 6/6 组合 success（run 34467629931，54s）；本地默认预算不变，76/76 全绿","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.5.3","files":".github/workflows/ci.yml"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:46:06.508Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:46:06.607Z","version":2,"hash":"55bc70d5735d6c2a4b638c6f20639a0bfd9a9069e1bbbe895d8050649243cbe2","tags":["fix","ci","perf"],"status":"approved"}
