{"type":"node","id":"issue019","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-019 export md 静默压缩正文连续空行（含代码块）","description":"toMarkdown 末尾全局 replace(/\\n{3,}/g,'\\n\\n') 作用于正文内部，静默改写原文","content":"【复现】add 节点 content=\"段一\\n\\n\\n\\n段三\\n\\n```\\ncode\\n\\n\\ncode\" 后 dtp export --format md：正文中 4 连续换行被压成 2，代码块内空行同样被压（grep 均不可命中原文）\n【期望】正文 content 原样保真（append-only 工具的导出不应改写内容字节）；空行压缩仅可用于结构排版\n【实际】lines.join(\"\\n\") 后对全文做 replace(/\\n{3,}/g, \"\\n\\n\")，无差别作用于 content 内部\n【影响】静默数据失真：代码块内空行有语义（markdown 围栏代码块内压缩不可逆），与「内容哈希保真」的项目理念冲突\n【修复方向】重构为结构化块拼接：节点级输出之间以固定空行分隔，content 原文整体嵌入不做全文正则替换","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"src/export.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.579Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.579Z","version":1,"hash":"509faaaf32d1b8a973f0f3c6a058959b20f32fe98117c2551e7cc0b0daca6618","tags":["P3","export","integrity"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue019","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"509faaaf32d1b8a973f0f3c6a058959b20f32fe98117c2551e7cc0b0daca6618","timestamp":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.579Z","user":"agent","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.579Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue020","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-020 export html TOC 无层级（平级 ul 直嵌 + 空格缩进被折叠）","description":"TOC 按深度生成多个平级 <ul>，ul 直嵌 ul 不合 HTML 规范，缩进靠空格被浏览器折叠","content":"【复现】两层树 export --format html，nav 内输出 <ul>\\n  <ul>\\n    <li>…：depth2 的 ul 直接嵌在 depth1 的 ul 内（不在 li 中），且层级仅靠空格缩进表达，浏览器渲染为无层级平铺列表\n【期望】TOC 用 li 内嵌套 ul 表达层级，浏览器可见缩进树\n【实际】tocHtml = toc.map((lvl,i) => 独立 ul).join(\"\\n\")，平级拼接\n【影响】HTML 导出的目录失去导航价值（无法目视区分父子）\n【修复方向】单根 <ul> 递归嵌套构建，li 内包 ul；跳层时中间补空 li 或合并层","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"src/export.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.613Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.613Z","version":1,"hash":"7e183870d88276f7025b403793b4e891e7939dd9c316044a71f4eb4c96073154","tags":["P3","export","html"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue020","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"7e183870d88276f7025b403793b4e891e7939dd9c316044a71f4eb4c96073154","timestamp":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.613Z","user":"agent","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.613Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue021","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-021 export html anchor 取 id 前 8 位可碰撞","description":"anchor=node-+id.slice(0,8)，自定义长 id 前 8 位相同时 TOC 链接互窜","content":"【复现】add 两个 id 分别为 abcdefgh 与 abcdefghx（均合法、完整 id 唯一），export html：两者 section id 均为 node-abcdefgh，TOC 中「节点乙」链接跳到「节点甲」\n【期望】anchor 唯一；完整 id 本身唯一，直接用 node-<完整id> 即可（id 禁空白与 /，配 escapeHtml 保属性安全）\n【实际】id.slice(0, 8) 截断引入人为碰撞面\n【影响】低频但确定的链接错位；自定义 id 场景可控复现\n【修复方向】anchor 改用完整 id 并经 escapeHtml 转义","extensions":{"severity":"P4","area":"src/export.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.648Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.648Z","version":1,"hash":"60a497a3ae403321e29526d94c7d9dc45b72b7cafa14fbfea6efbb33a8070582","tags":["P4","export","html"],"status":"review"}
