{"type":"node","id":"optim003","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-003 export md 正文标题层级与 init --version 校验（暂缓）","description":"export md 正文标题层级与深层 clamp h6 维持暂缓；html 双 h1 部分已拆出由 OPTIM-014 推进","content":"【export md】节点 content 以 \"# 标题\" 开头时直接内嵌会与节点标题层级冲突；可选方案：按 depth 提升 content 内标题级别，但会改写内容形态，需权衡\n【init --version】无格式校验；可加宽松校验（^v?\\d+ 开头）或保持自由文本，倾向后者+文档说明","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"commands/export.js,commands/init.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:56.075Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.751Z","version":2,"hash":"24bfa442e0fb5295cca83aef7ae54707978e95b4d30cae097f40992927903074","tags":["P3","export","init"],"status":"draft"}
