{"type":"node","id":"issue021","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-021 export html anchor 取 id 前 8 位可碰撞","description":"anchor=node-+id.slice(0,8)，自定义长 id 前 8 位相同时 TOC 链接互窜","content":"【复现】add 两个 id 分别为 abcdefgh 与 abcdefghx（均合法、完整 id 唯一），export html：两者 section id 均为 node-abcdefgh，TOC 中「节点乙」链接跳到「节点甲」\n【期望】anchor 唯一；完整 id 本身唯一，直接用 node-<完整id> 即可（id 禁空白与 /，配 escapeHtml 保属性安全）\n【实际】id.slice(0, 8) 截断引入人为碰撞面\n【影响】低频但确定的链接错位；自定义 id 场景可控复现\n【修复方向】anchor 改用完整 id 并经 escapeHtml 转义","extensions":{"severity":"P4","area":"src/export.js","fixed_in":"v1.5.4"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T10:53:39.648Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T11:07:27.395Z","version":3,"hash":"c71fe7d46e3549c9c32fecab29667f009cb955a84407e1eba8e54695c81a2d3c","tags":["P4","export","html"],"status":"approved"}
