{"type":"node","id":"optim018","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-018 扩展字段数组包含查询与 keyword 覆盖（暂缓）","description":"ext 数组只能整组深比较命中，无法按单条包含检索；keyword 不搜 extensions（暂缓）","content":"【现状】query --ext acceptance=单条 → 0 命中（canonicalJson 全组深比较）；keyword 仅搜 title/description/content，扩展字段文本无检索路径（task content【验收标准】段可兜底）\n【建议】引入数组 contains 语义（如 acceptance*=…）或 keyword 纳入 extensions 文本\n【取舍】（暂缓）查询语法扩展属语义变更需 OPTIM 设计；现有 --json + 完整数组匹配 + content 兜底可用\n【验证】若推进：contains 命中含该条目的所有数组、不影响既有精确匹配","extensions":{"severity":"P4","area":"src/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.874Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.874Z","version":1,"hash":"073e8e1b354f146f66c4630582012e25c81100013dc9558672866765040bb992","tags":["P4","query","ext"],"status":"draft"}
