{"type":"node","id":"fix007","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-007 query 参数校验收紧（ISSUE-011/012/013）","description":"--limit 改严格整数校验；空过滤值显式拒绝（消除 fail-open）；非法枚举退出码归入用法错误 2","content":"【根因】① query.js 用 Number.parseInt 解析 --limit，带小数/尾随字符/进制前缀被静默截断；② tag/type/status/keyword/path 空值经 split 后被 filter(Boolean) 丢弃，等价于无过滤（fail-open）；③ main.js 退出码映射只认 USAGE/EXISTS，INVALID_TYPE/STATUS 落到 1\n【改动】query.js：--limit 用 /^\\d+$/ 严格校验（trim 后），非匹配即 USAGE；新增 requireNonEmpty/requireNonEmptyRaw，对已提供但解析为空的 tag/type/status/keyword/path 抛 USAGE；main.js：退出码映射纳入 INVALID_TYPE/INVALID_STATUS → 2；package.json bump v1.4.0\n【验证】新增 test/query-edges.test.js 3 组：limit 非整数（1.5/2abc/1e2/0x10/-1/abc）均 USAGE exit2 且合法值不受影响；非法枚举 exit2；5 个空过滤值均 USAGE，逗号列表空段仍按原语义丢弃；60/60 测试全绿","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.4.0","issues":"ISSUE-011,ISSUE-012,ISSUE-013"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T04:27:03.143Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:56:46.645Z","version":4,"hash":"b0e8b0d8c33f80401b31250647cdcd5febf245f3a9c032a6041d8e95893c3d3c","tags":["fix","P2","P3","query","validation","exit-code"],"status":"approved"}
