{"type":"node","id":"fix003","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-003 写路径篡改巡检 warnings（ISSUE-004）","description":"","content":"【设计】不阻断写入（保持既定语义：仅 STRUCTURE 阻断），但加载时巡检当前状态节点哈希，发现不匹配 → 写命令 JSON 附 warnings 字段 + stderr 黄色提示\n【改动】packet.js 新增 hashMismatches()（与 verify 同源校验）；main.js ctx.load() 缓存 __hashWarnings 并 stderr 预警；_shared.js 新增 hashWarnFields()；add/update/rm/mv/checkout 五个写命令 out.ok 透传\n【边界确认】篡改历史版本行不可检出（append-only 重放模型只锚定最新状态，后行覆盖前行）；写入即洗白（哈希重算），警告仅在洗白前最后一次机会发出\n【验证】篡改当前状态行后 update JSON warnings+stderr 正确；干净包无 warnings 字段 stderr 干净；49/49 绿","extensions":{"files":"src/packet.js,src/main.js,src/commands/_shared.js,src/commands/add.js,src/commands/update.js,src/commands/rm.js,src/commands/mv.js,src/commands/checkout.js","fixed_in":"v1.2.0","issues":"ISSUE-004"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:46:54.650Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:56:46.804Z","version":3,"hash":"1e82ceeca76c73dc8b09e3a972fd50d4ddda051f66d1015750c3803e12a7e6c6","tags":["fix","integrity","write-path"],"status":"approved"}
