{"type":"node","id":"fix006","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-006 update 支持 +tag/-tag 增量标签","description":"OPTIM-004 落地：update --tags 支持增量添加/移除，无前缀仍整体替换","content":"【根因】update.js 将 --tags 直接整体替换（patch.tags = 解析后的数组），无增量语义；回归工作流中「给一条加 P3」需回读全量标签\\n【改动】update.js 检测任一 --tags 值以 +/- 前缀开头即进入增量模式：基于当前标签集 + 加入 / - 移除（对无前缀项按增量加入处理，trim+去重复用既有 normalizeTags）；无 +/- 前缀时保持整体替换，向后兼容\\n【验证】新增 CLI 用例覆盖 +tag / -tag / 混合 +- / 整体替换向后兼容 / 查询命中；57/57 测试全绿","extensions":{"severity":"P3","files":"src/commands/update.js,test/cli.test.js","issues":"OPTIM-004","fixed_in":"v1.4.0"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T01:54:02.073Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:56:46.842Z","version":3,"hash":"08f98b9e73b4858c60ca4801feabad9d553f8855484ce668b408a2385c0a7823","tags":["fix","update","tags"],"status":"approved"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"fix006","field":"extensions.fixed_in","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"567a91b5fc074e1725e43984efba78107a8ecb64d5965062d1f2098fe19973e8","timestamp":"2026-09-11T02:56:46.842Z","user":"dev-pane","version":3}
