{"type":"node","id":"fix014","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-014 历史登记批量补录（lint 14 error 清零）","description":"按 ISSUE-024 逐条补录，推导依据如下","content":"【根因】见 ISSUE-024：早期收尾未回填 ext/标签，lint 引入后集中暴露。\n【补录清单与依据】\n1. fix001 fixed_in=v1.2.0 issues=ISSUE-001,ISSUE-005 ← 标题「含 ISSUE-001/005」；issue001/005 自带 fixed_in=v1.2.0\n2. fix002 fixed_in=v1.2.0 issues=ISSUE-002,ISSUE-003 ← issue002/003 均 v1.2.0\n3. fix003 fixed_in=v1.2.0 issues=ISSUE-004 ← issue004 v1.2.0\n4. fix006 fixed_in=v1.4.0 ← 创建 2026-09-10T01:54 夹于 v1.3.0 批次（fix005 09-09T17:55）与 v1.4.0 批次（fix007 09-10T04:27）之间；+tag/-tag 特性含于初始公开提交 ca866ef\n5. fix011 issues=none ← 包内无 CI 相关 ISSUE/OPTIM 登记（query 复核）；git 66581f8(ci)→f768eef(登记 FIX-011) 直登无前置；语义依 OPTIM-020\n6. fix004/005/007/008 前置 fix 标签（update --tags 全量替换，保留既有标签）\n7. optim001 area=src/model/node.js ← 标题「status/type 枚举校验一致性」指向 model/node.js\n8. optim004 area=src/commands/update.js ← 其修复 FIX-006 files 字段同源\n【验证】dtp lint --packet docs/dtp-regression.dtp → 0 error 0 warn；dtp verify 全绿；npm test 133/133","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.5.5","issues":"ISSUE-024","files":"docs/dtp-regression.dtp","done_evidence":"dtp lint 0 error 0 warn（2026-09-11）；dtp verify 全绿"},"created_at":"2026-09-11T02:57:27.168Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T02:57:27.168Z","version":1,"hash":"ed22f6f46a830f8b2585e5e648b0486d2aee85745fc8a393f91e2343b5e35307","tags":["fix","docs"],"status":"approved"}
