{"type":"node","id":"issue024","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-024 回归包历史登记违反自身约定（14 处缺字段/标签，lint 检出）","description":"lint 引入后集中暴露的历史欠账","content":"【复现】bind dtp-regression.schema.json 后执行 dtp lint --packet docs/dtp-regression.dtp → 14 error：optim001/004 缺 area；fix001/002/003 缺 fixed_in+issues；fix006 缺 fixed_in；fix011 缺 issues；fix004/005/007/008 缺 fix 标签。\n【影响】登记约定失真：FIX「必有 fixed_in」等 SKILL 明文约束在 5 个早期 FIX 上不成立，编号-版本-覆盖关系无法机器追溯。\n【根因】早期 dogfooding 收尾未强制回填；lint（US-002）引入前无机器校验。","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"docs/dtp-regression.dtp","fixed_in":"v1.6.0"},"created_at":"2026-09-11T02:57:13.427Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T03:25:22.449Z","version":2,"hash":"99e6c7f5ba00ff48b95c4c2382aa591e72409e5b89fb843eebeaafc4297b96e1","tags":["P3","docs"],"status":"approved"}
