{"type":"node","id":"issue028","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-028 dtp web --host 空串静默绑定全网卡（TCP *:port），与默认仅本机约定相悖","description":"空 host 非 nullish 故透传 listen(port,'')，Node 绑定全部网卡（lsof TCP *:port）；应 USAGE 拒绝空值。","content":"【复现】`dtp web --port 40050 --dir /tmp/ws --host \"\" --json` → 启动成功，JSON `\"host\":\"\"`、`\"url\":\"http://:40050\"`（url 残缺）；\n`lsof -nP -iTCP:40050 -sTCP:LISTEN` → `node … TCP *:40050 (LISTEN)`（全网卡，IPv6 wildcard 双栈）。\n对照默认：`dtp web --port 40051 --dir /tmp/ws` → `TCP 127.0.0.1:40051 (LISTEN)`。\n（Node 侧最小复现：`http.createServer().listen(p,'')` 的 `address()` 为 `{\"address\":\"::\",\"family\":\"IPv6\"}`。）\n【期望】空/纯空白 `--host` 按显式空值报 USAGE（与 ISSUE-013 / ISSUE-022 的空值治理一致），或至少回落默认 127.0.0.1；绝不静默扩大监听面。\n【实际】src/commands/web.js 取 `host ?? process.env.HOST ?? '127.0.0.1'`；`\"\"` 非 nullish 故 HOST=`\"\"`，`server.listen(port,\"\")` 被 Node 解释为全网卡绑定，同时产出残缺 url。\n【影响】安全相关 fail-open：文档宣称「默认 127.0.0.1，仅本机访问」，而 `--host \"\"`（脚本变量未展开/空值透传是常见成因）会把可视化控制台静默暴露到局域网，且启动输出看不出异常。\n【修复方向】host 先 trim；空值 → USAGE（文案给「对外监听请用 --host 0.0.0.0」指引）。","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"src/commands/web.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-14T10:38:34.415Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T10:38:34.415Z","version":1,"hash":"8142637cd42c973e74b51aeb8eb9ce01772d8e499f6f8d2128398a70c34d9ceb","tags":["P2","web","security","fail-open"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue028","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"8142637cd42c973e74b51aeb8eb9ce01772d8e499f6f8d2128398a70c34d9ceb","timestamp":"2026-09-14T10:38:34.415Z","user":"regression","version":1}
