{"type":"node","id":"optim021","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-021 dtp web --dir 显式空串被当作「未提供」静默回落","description":"空 --dir 静默回落解析链且报错文案称「无 --dir」；应 USAGE 拒绝显式空值。","content":"【现状】`dtp web --dir \"\"`（显式空串）被 src/config.js `resolveWebWorkspace` 的 `if (explicitDir)` 判为「未提供」，静默回落 DTP_WORKSPACE → config → 最终 NO_PACKET；报错文案仍是「无 --dir、未设 DTP_WORKSPACE…」，对「用户已传 --dir」构成误导。\n【建议】显式空/纯空白 `--dir` → USAGE（「--dir 需要是非空目录路径」），与 ISSUE-013 / ISSUE-022 的显式空值治理对齐；`DTP_WORKSPACE=\"\"` 仍按「未设置」处理（环境变量空值语义不同于显式 CLI 值）。\n【取舍】收益：消除静默回落与误导文案，接线一致；成本：一处判空，极小。采纳（随本轮修复）。\n【验证】`dtp web --dir \"\" --json` 与 `--dir \"  \"` 应 exit 2 / USAGE；省略 `--dir` 仍走 DTP_WORKSPACE > .dtp/ 回落链（现有用例覆盖）。","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"src/config.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-14T10:38:34.537Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T10:38:34.537Z","version":1,"hash":"67f357fc375a3e9ca9140ddb9af8a2eec25a9ef8ebd4527dbb41b97833b91484","tags":["P3","web","validation"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim021","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"67f357fc375a3e9ca9140ddb9af8a2eec25a9ef8ebd4527dbb41b97833b91484","timestamp":"2026-09-14T10:38:34.537Z","user":"regression","version":1}
