{"type":"node","id":"optim022","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-022 web listen 失败统一映射 USAGE，环境类错误文案与退出码语义待定（暂缓）","description":"start() 失败一律 USAGE(exit2) 且部分为原始 Node 文案（--port 1 → listen EACCES…）；文案先改、退出码语义留下一轮。","content":"【现状】`start()` 的任何失败在 src/commands/web.js 被统一 `throw new DtpError('USAGE', e.message)`：`dtp web --port 1`（非 root）→ `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":{\"code\":\"USAGE\",\"message\":\"listen EACCES: permission denied 127.0.0.1:1\"}}`（原始 Node 文案、无指引）；端口占用虽有精心文案但也归为 USAGE（exit 2）。\n【建议】按错误类别分派：环境类（EACCES/EADDRNOTAVAIL 等）给出「换端口/检查权限」指引；退出码语义复核——环境失败更接近业务错误（1）而非用法错误（2）。EADDRINUSE 文案已达标，可保留。\n【取舍】收益：错误可行动、退出码契约自洽；成本：小，但涉及 1 vs 2 的退出码口径，属语义取舍，需确认后再改。倾向：文案先改，退出码留下一轮统一评估。暂缓（本轮不修）。\n【验证】`dtp web --port 1`（非 root）文案含可行动指引；`--port <已占用>` 文案保持；退出码按定稿口径断言。","extensions":{"severity":"P4","area":"src/commands/web.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-14T10:38:34.577Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T10:38:34.577Z","version":1,"hash":"0cff5a574a6ee388ea325ce672ce3df88863a3a8c9a97d94f5c3d32a8e16edd8","tags":["P4","web","errmsg","exit-code"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim022","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"0cff5a574a6ee388ea325ce672ce3df88863a3a8c9a97d94f5c3d32a8e16edd8","timestamp":"2026-09-14T10:38:34.577Z","user":"regression","version":1}
