{"type":"node","id":"issue031","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-031 测试使用 import.meta.dirname（Node 20.11+）致 Node 18 矩阵失败","description":"engines 承诺 >=18.17 但测试用了 Node 20.11+ API","content":"【复现】CI run 34834713275（v1.7.0 push）：Node 18 · ubuntu-latest 两文件级失败——test/webui-api.test.js:11 与 test/init-builtin.test.js:98 使用 import.meta.dirname（Node 20.11+ 才有，Node 18 为 undefined）→ path.resolve(undefined) TypeError / ERR_INVALID_ARG_TYPE；Node 20/22/24 全过。\n【期望】engines >=18.17 内全部矩阵绿。\n【实际】Node 18 job 红，两文件模块加载即抛。\n【影响】CI 矩阵失真：engines 承诺与实际测试覆盖不符；阻断「支持 Node 18」的可信度。\n【修复方向】两处改 path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url))（src/commands/init.js PKG_ROOT 正确先例）；顺带扫描四套新测试的单版本隐患。","extensions":{"severity":"P1","area":"test/webui-api.test.js,test/init-builtin.test.js","fixed_in":"v1.7.0"},"created_at":"2026-09-14T10:52:31.149Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T10:52:31.149Z","version":1,"hash":"44e39456a6c3e7cddc5ba2bb50f5170401433a73b6fe6745b5d42980f34c62e4","tags":["P1","test","ci"],"status":"approved"}
