{"type":"node","id":"fix018","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-018 测试 Node 18 兼容：import.meta.dirname 替换为 fileURLToPath 先例","description":"两处 API 替换 + 端口段避让 ephemeral 范围","content":"【根因】import.meta.dirname 为 Node 20.11+ 新增，Node 18 下为 undefined；TASK-010/011 新测试直接使用，engines >=18.17 承诺与测试矩阵不符（CI run 34834713275 Node 18 job 红，20/22/24 过）。\n【改动】test/webui-api.test.js:11 与 test/init-builtin.test.js:98 两处改 path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url))（src/commands/init.js PKG_ROOT 正确先例）；顺带将 webui-api 随机端口从 30000-39999（与 Linux ephemeral 32768+ 重叠）调整至 4761 产品段+随机偏移，降低 CI 偶发端口碰撞。\n【验证】本地 npm test 179/179 全绿（Node 24）；四套新测试单版本隐患扫描：Node 20+ 独有 API（mock.timers/fs.glob/toSorted/Array.fromAsync 等）无、时区/locale 依赖无、平台分支仅产品代码 web.js 的 openBrowser（正确处理）。CI Node 18 转绿为最终验收。","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.7.0","issues":"ISSUE-031","files":"test/webui-api.test.js,test/init-builtin.test.js","done_evidence":"本地 npm test 179/179（Node 24）；CI Node 18 job 转绿（run 见回执）"},"created_at":"2026-09-14T10:53:59.933Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T10:53:59.933Z","version":1,"hash":"52c09474c21e7df1b9a99a2617cc4f87096508a3b04243464fb6dce154fdf2f4","tags":["fix","test","ci"],"status":"approved"}
